  "level_notes": {
    "0": "Theoretical calculus - level 0 lists reference type checkers (Pierce's TAPL fullpoly), mechanised metatheory (Coq/Autosubst, Agda) and production compilers whose core language is an extension of System F (GHC Core / System FC).",
    "1": "Defined by Girard's 1971/72 work and Reynolds' 1974 paper; several publisher links are paywalled and report 'blocked'. Girard's thesis is linked from his own site."
  },
